          <h3>Local economy</h3>
          <p class="placeholder-copy">During his time with each team, outside of the Lakers 2020 season (COVID), there is an increase in the number of employees within the Hospitality and Leisure industry. This includes hotels, dining, and entertainment (sports events included). While this can't be tied down as a direct causation, it is interesting to note that his presence may have led to more money being spent to see him. What's really interesting is the trend for Cleveland where there is a dip around 2010, when James left for the Heat and really spikes up for 2014 when he returned.</p>
